{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/letter-from-the-secretary-of-state-for-education-to-the-ceo-of-the-competition-and-markets-authority","content_id":"af9f5e78-d621-45d8-a1a0-d49f6f942670","description":"A letter from Bridget Phillipson, Secretary of State for Education, to Sarah Cardell, CEO of the CMA. ","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a1002810a1a96d9418d27b9","filename":"SoS_Letter_to_CMA_CEO.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":129931,"filename":"SoS_Letter_to_CMA_CEO.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9398638","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Letter from the Secretary of State for Education to the CEO of CMA","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a1002810a1a96d9418d27b9/SoS_Letter_to_CMA_CEO.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Rt Hon Bridget Phillipson MP, Secretary of State for Education, wrote to Sarah Cardell, the chief executive of the Competition and Markets Authority (<abbr title=\"Competition and Markets Authority\">CMA</abbr>) on 26 May 2026, requesting that the <abbr title=\"Competition and Markets Authority\">CMA</abbr> conduct an independent review of the English early years childcare market.</p>\n\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>Read the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/cma-response-to-government-in-relation-to-childcare-provision\">response to the Secretary of State’s letter from the CEO of <abbr title=\"Competition and Markets Authority\">CMA</abbr></a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:13:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["93